project_root/
├── scripts/
│   ├── floorplan_main.tcl           # Main orchestration script
│   ├── design_config.tcl            # Design parameters and variables
│   ├── path_config.tcl              # All file paths and directories
│   ├── pin_placement.tcl            # Pin placement module
│   ├── macro_placement.tcl          # Macro placement and regioning module
│   └── power_grid.tcl               # Power grid creation module
│
├── netlist/
│   └── my_design_synth.v            # Synthesized gate-level netlist
│
├── constraints/
│   ├── my_design.sdc                # Main timing constraints
│   ├── my_design_floorplan.sdc      # Floorplan-specific constraints
│   └── ...                          # Other SDC files
│
├── tech/
│   ├── tech.lef                     # Technology LEF (layers, vias, rules)
│   ├── stdcells.lef                 # Standard cell library LEF
│   ├── io.lef                       # IO pad library LEF
│   └── macros.lef                   # List of macro LEF files
│
├── lib/
│   ├── stdcells_fast.lib            # Fast corner timing library
│   ├── stdcells_slow.lib            # Slow corner timing library
│   ├── stdcells_typ.lib             # Typical corner timing library
│   └── ...                          # Other .lib files
│
├── def/
│   ├── my_design_pins.def           # Pin locations (optional - for import)
│   └── my_design_macros.def         # Macro placements (optional - for import)
│
├── reports/                         # Generated reports (auto-created)
├── results/                         # Output files (auto-created)
└── logs/                            # Log files (auto-created)

File Descriptions
Configuration Files
1. design_config.tcl
Contains all design-specific parameters:

Design name and top module
Technology node
Floorplan parameters (utilization, aspect ratio)
Power/ground net names
Pin placement parameters
Macro placement parameters
Power grid parameters
Timing parameters
Placement and routing parameters

2. path_config.tcl
Contains all file paths and directories:

Project root directory
Input directories (netlist, constraints, tech, def, lib)
Output directories (reports, results, logs)
Netlist file paths
SDC file paths
LEF file paths
Timing library paths
DEF file paths
Subscript paths
Output file paths
Path verification function

Main Script
3. floorplan_main.tcl
Main orchestration script that:

Loads configuration files (design_config.tcl, path_config.tcl)
Verifies critical files exist
Creates output directories
Loads technology files and libraries
Reads synthesized netlist
Reads timing constraints (SDC)
Initializes floorplan
Calls pin placement script
Calls macro placement script
Calls power grid script
Creates placement and routing blockages
Generates reports
Saves floorplan (DEF and database)
Runs final checks

Module Scripts
4. pin_placement.tcl
Handles pin placement:

Imports pins from DEF or auto-places them
Configures pin layers and spacing
Handles pin grouping and side constraints
Verifies pin placement
Generates pin reports

5. macro_placement.tcl
Handles macro placement and regioning:

Gets list of hard macros
Imports or auto-places macros
Creates regions for hierarchical placement
Sets macro orientations
Creates halos/keepout zones around macros
Verifies macro placement
Generates macro reports

6. power_grid.tcl
Creates power distribution network:

Creates power rings around core and macros
Creates power stripes on multiple metal layers (M1, M4, M7)
Connects all layers with vias
Connects macros to power grid
Verifies power grid connectivity
Performs power grid analysis
Generates power grid reports

